    "body": "The current text reads:\r\n\r\n> Let parsedValue be the result of [parsing](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#parse-a-css-color-value) the given value with [this](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this)'s [canvas](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-context-2d-canvas) attribute's value.\r\n\r\nThe `canvas` attribute returns the element.\r\n\r\nWe shouldn't pass anything though when that is not a `canvas` element as is the case for `OffscreenCanvas`. That's a bug.\r\n\r\nFor reference: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#parse-a-css-color-value",
